	(descr "Four M2 holes for screwing a Plantower PMS5003 to the board from below, on its 45 x 33 mm hole pattern (Plantower PMS5003 manual v2.3, outline drawing: 4-M2 self-tapping holes). The origin is the centre of the 50 x 38 mm case. Each hole has a 2.5 mm radius keep-out on the bottom copper for the screw head.")
